@startuml sequence
actor User
participant "Webブラウザ" as Browser
participant "Flaskアプリケーション" as App
database "MySQL" as DB

== 学生情報登録 ==
User -> Browser: 学生情報入力
Browser -> App: POST /register_student
App -> DB: INSERT INTO students
DB --> App: 登録完了
App --> Browser: リダイレクト
Browser --> User: 完了画面表示

== 進級希望登録 ==
User -> Browser: 進級希望入力
Browser -> App: POST /register_promotion_request
App -> DB: INSERT INTO advancement_preferences
DB --> App: 登録完了
App --> Browser: リダイレクト
Browser --> User: 完了画面表示

== スケジュール登録 ==
User -> Browser: スケジュール入力
Browser -> App: POST /register_teacher_schedule
App -> DB: INSERT INTO teacher_weekly_schedule
DB --> App: 登録完了
App --> Browser: リダイレクト
Browser --> User: 完了画面表示

@enduml 